    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s1"
}

{
  "bridge_text": "The secret behind Mosk's grumpy frown remains tucked away in his heart, but as he stares at the apple, the path ahead begins to shift. Let us see what happens when Lina offers him a kindness.",
